# Build context for app/Dockerfile (the repo root, because the npm workspace's
# lockfile lives there). Docker reads this file because it sits next to that
# Dockerfile, so it never affects other builds. The api image uses ./api.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.env*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.vercel
api
docs
roadmap
changelog
openapi
npm-debug.log*
